║    stdin → LLM → WASM Sandbox Tool → Response → stdout     ║
║                                                            ║
║  Tools run inside a Wasmtime WASM sandbox:                 ║
║    • Fuel-limited (prevents infinite loops)                ║
║    • No filesystem/network access                          ║
