║    • Fresh instance per execution (no state leak)          ║
║                                                            ║
║  Config: ./HAI_WOA.json (or ~/HAI_WOA.json)                ║
║                                                            ║
║  Try:                                                      ║
║    • "What is 42 + 58?"                                    ║
║    • "Calculate 100 divided by 3"                          ║
║    • "Hello" (direct response, no tool)                    ║
║    • "/model <name>" to switch model (ds, qwen, kimi...)   ║
║    • "/models" to list available models                    ║
║    • "quit" to exit                                        ║
